        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "This Memorandum of Understanding will confirm our May 28, 1995 agreement regarding the establishment of Maintenance Points of Presence (MPOP's) to facilitate the provision of maintenance services outside of the existing Base Locations listed in CWA-21.",
