        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4 The Company will evaluate the job skills, knowledge, training, and experience of volunteer candidates for the MPOP job assignment(s). The selection from volunteer candidates who are qualified for the MPOP assignment(s) shall proceed according to the following priority:",
